## Report — `com.intermarche.valuation.engine.ItemValuation`

**Coverage: 100%** — Branches **24/24**, Instructions **334/334**, Lines **70/70**, Complexity 14/14. Zero missed.

**Branch inventory (all covered):**
| Location | Branch | Test |
|---|---|---|
| L45 `slices.isEmpty()` (true) | empty items → early return | `testDistribute_emptyItems_returnsEmpty` |
| L45 `offerTotal == null` (true) | null total, non-empty items | `testDistribute_nullOfferTotal_returnsEmpty` |
| L45 both false | normal path | all pricing tests |
