| `validateChange`: `!mustChangePassword` | voluntary tests | forcedSucceeds |
| `validateChange`: `!matchesPassword(current)` | rejectsWrongCurrent | correct-current tests |
| `validateChange`: `policyError != null` | rejectsPolicyViolation | others |
| `validateChange`: `!newPassword.equals(confirmation)` | rejectsConfirmationMismatch | others |
| `validateChange`: `matchesPassword(newPassword)` | rejectsUnchangedPassword | success tests |
| `currentUser`: `username.isEmpty()` | empty-identity redirects | authenticated tests |
| `currentUsername`: `identity == null` | redirectsWhenIdentityNull | others |
| `currentUsername`: `isAnonymous()` | redirectsWhenAnonymous | authenticated |
